I recommend trying ADVI form many different starting points and taking the one that gives the highest score.  ADVI can be highly sensitive to starting points.  Alp and Tianhao and I are working on improving ADVi's adaptation, but for now we think it can help to give savvy starting points.  That won't always help but it can be worth a shot.

