> Bob just posted some code in another thread <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/stan-users/nk03n8hX4Us/-pTN5IGjCQAJ> that I think helps me here. Is it correct that the way to have a multivariate student-t with different degrees of freedom for each axis, I would do (the lines I've changed are commented out with my elaboration immediately below):
>
