The model in section 8.13 (pg 145 & 146) demonstrates how to take in a matrix of predictors as I believe you want. You need to declare X to be a Nx2 matrix in the data block, beta as a Nx2 matrix in the parameters block, nix the creation of mu, and simply do:

    y ~ normal( rows_dot_product( x , beta[subj] ) , sigma) ;

in the parameters block.

